  "description": "YITAMOTOR high-quality headlights will let all of the light through, allowing your headlights to work the way they were originally made to.\nFitment\n2014-2021 Toyota Tundra Headlight Assembly\nFits halogen headlight models only\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nBoost visibility with style: LED daytime running lamp dramatically improves the appearance of your vehicle and provides better illumination for greater driving safety and increased visibility\nWaterproof: Fully sealed with solid silicone and equipped with one-way pressure-equalizing vents, the housing prevents moisture buildup and condensation\nBrighter & safer: compared to other ordinary headlights, the advanced projector lens provides a sharper and more focused beam of light with less scatter loss for a safer ride at night\nSafety reflector: the sided micro-prism reflector makes the oncoming cars or passerby quickly notice you at night, ensuring your driving safety and others'\nImpact resistance: the polycarbonate lens & tough housing are highly resistant to shock, vibration for any tough road; professional installation would be highly recommended",
